ul evaluation, **B: a1-b2** stands out as the best — it develops a piece, increases activity, and prepares for central play.\n\nOther moves like **P: c6-c5** are also good, but slightly less impactful.\n\n**P: f7-f5** is riskier.\n\nSo I choose B: a1-b2.\n\nAnswer: B: a1-b2'}
