t in this context — too far from the action.\n\nReason: Queening the pawn on g2 is the highest-value move, providing an overwhelming material advantage. Since there is no check, capture, or threat preventing the promotion, and no more urgent tactical sequence (like a forced mate), promoting to a queen maximizes winning chances immediately.\n\nAnswer: P: g2-g1-q"}
